{"lines": ["¿Sigues respirando? Pues lo estás haciendo de la verga.", "Cómo respirar. Sí, pendejo, respirar. Alguien tenía que decirlo.", "Primero, abra la nariz. Ese par de hoyos donde se mete el dedo, cochino.", "Ahora jale aire. Despacio. No se chingue toda la habitación, animal.", "Sostenga. Uno... dos... pinche tres.", "Ahora suelte el aire. Con cuidado... Ah, valió verga.", "Felicidades. Ya respira. Ahora váyase a la chingada, que yo ya cobré."], "words": [["¿Sigues", 0.0, 0.279], ["respirando?", 0.325, 1.115], ["Pues", 1.614, 1.811], ["lo", 1.846, 1.892], ["estás", 1.916, 2.09], ["haciendo", 2.125, 2.392], ["de", 2.415, 2.461], ["la", 2.496, 2.543], ["verga.", 2.577, 3.123], ["Cómo", 3.622, 3.843], ["respirar.", 3.889, 4.632], ["Sí,", 5.132, 5.422], ["pendejo,", 5.457, 5.909], ["respirar.", 5.944, 6.676], ["Alguien", 7.047, 7.361], ["tenía", 7.396, 7.628], ["que", 7.674, 7.744], ["decirlo.", 7.779, 8.44], ["Primero,", 9.021, 9.636], ["abra", 9.729, 9.927], ["la", 9.95, 9.996], ["nariz.", 10.031, 10.507], ["Ese", 10.832, 11.029], ["par", 11.076, 11.192], ["de", 11.238, 11.285], ["hoyos", 11.331, 11.587], ["donde", 11.61, 11.749], ["se", 11.784, 11.831], ["mete", 11.889, 12.063], ["el", 12.086, 12.132], ["dedo,", 12.19, 12.411], ["cochino.", 12.434, 13.003], ["Ahora", 13.433, 13.677], ["jale", 13.723, 13.92], ["aire.", 13.955, 14.35], ["Despacio.", 14.42, 15.128], ["No", 15.499, 15.592], ["se", 15.615, 15.674], ["chingue", 15.709, 15.906], ["toda", 15.941, 16.069], ["la", 16.092, 16.138], ["habitación,", 16.161, 16.603], ["animal.", 16.626, 17.055], ["Sostenga.", 17.485, 18.1], ["Uno...", 18.6, 19.11], ["dos...", 19.784, 20.318], ["pinche", 20.817, 21.096], ["tres.", 21.131, 21.595], ["Ahora", 22.094, 22.292], ["suelte", 22.338, 22.57], ["el", 22.593, 22.64], ["aire.", 22.686, 23.069], ["Con", 23.65, 23.778], ["cuidado...", 23.812, 24.393], ["Ah,", 25.066, 25.264], ["valió", 25.287, 25.484], ["verga.", 25.542, 26.088], ["Felicidades.", 26.459, 27.365], ["Ya", 2